### DB 연결
GET http://localhost:8088/api/system

### 목록 검색
GET http://localhost:8088/api/sales/customers?page=1&size=10&field=C_NAME&keyword=상사

### 상품 목록
GET http://localhost:8088/api/sales/products?page=1&size=10

### 재고 목록
GET http://localhost:8088/api/sales/stocks?page=1&size=10

### 거래 목록
GET http://localhost:8088/api/sales/trades?page=1&size=10

### 상세 (목록의 _rowId를 입력)
GET http://localhost:8088/api/sales/customers/{{rowId}}

### 등록 (실제 Oracle 데이터가 추가됩니다)
POST http://localhost:8088/api/sales/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{"values":{"C_CODE":"12345","C_NAME":"테스트 거래처","C_CEO":null,"C_ADDR":null,"C_PHONE":null}}

### 수정 (상세의 _version을 입력)
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/sales/customers/{{rowId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"values":{"C_CODE":"12345","C_NAME":"수정 거래처","C_CEO":null,"C_ADDR":null,"C_PHONE":null},"version":"{{version}}"}

### 삭제 (실제 Oracle에서 선택한 행 1건이 삭제됩니다)
DELETE http://localhost:8088/api/sales/customers/{{rowId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":"{{version}}"}
